I need to go collect things.

3110
03:03:30,430 --> 03:03:30,810
What?

3111
03:03:35,760 --> 03:03:36,520
Oh, Christ.

3112
03:03:36,860 --> 03:03:37,420
Oh, Christ.

3113
03:03:42,890 --> 03:03:44,230
Oh, he's really mad.

3114
03:03:49,090 --> 03:03:50,010
Nothing in that one.

3115
03:03:50,170 --> 03:03:50,230
Nothing in that one.

3116
03:03:52,810 --> 03:03:54,150
Let me just heal off the max here.

3117
03:03:54,510 --> 03:03:54,870
No problem.

3118
03:03:56,770 --> 03:03:57,930
Oh, he's so angry.

3119
03:04:00,090 --> 03:04:01,370
Stop telling me that, Navi.

3120
03:04:01,490 --> 03:04:02,190
I swear to God.

3121
03:04:17,300 --> 03:04:17,800
Get it.

3122
03:04:17,920 --> 03:04:18,200
There we go.

3123
03:04:21,550 --> 03:04:21,950
Nice.

3124
03:04:23,550 --> 03:04:24,150
What now?

3125
03:04:27,990 --> 03:04:28,930
Oy, he got me.

3126
03:04:34,690 --> 03:04:38,490
I think we got it.

3127
03:04:40,670 --> 03:04:41,430
Nastiness.

3128
03:04:58,850 --> 03:05:00,050
Oh, it's beautiful.

3129
03:05:01,090 --> 03:05:02,790
Maximum life energy increased.

3130
03:05:04,690 --> 03:05:05,890
There she is.

3131
03:05:08,880 --> 03:05:10,060
She's in the...

3132
03:05:10,060 --> 03:05:10,940
Okay, so...

3133
03:05:10,940 --> 03:05:12,240
She's not on the other side, right?

3134
03:05:13,200 --> 03:05:14,320
No, she's in there.

3135
03:05:22,010 --> 03:05:22,270
You!

3136
03:05:22,850 --> 03:05:23,790
You're late.

3137
03:05:24,310 --> 03:05:25,790
What took you so long?

3138
03:05:26,270 --> 03:05:27,350
You're useless.

3139
03:05:32,580 --> 03:05:34,620
I was just lonely, that's all.

3140
03:05:35,040 --> 03:05:35,840
Just a little.

3141
03:05:42,680 --> 03:05:43,800
So bossy.

3142
03:05:54,910 --> 03:05:55,470
What?

3143
03:05:57,190 --> 03:05:58,170
Link, are you alright?

3144
03:06:07,770 --> 03:06:08,330
You!

3145
03:06:08,930 --> 03:06:10,230
You looked cool!

3146
03:06:10,770 --> 03:06:12,510
Cooler than I thought you would anyway.

3147
03:06:12,990 --> 03:06:13,550
Just a little.

3148
03:06:14,690 --> 03:06:15,750
Well, anyway.

3149
03:06:16,070 --> 03:06:18,150
You saved me, so I guess I'll reward you.

3150
03:06:19,370 --> 03:06:20,350
What do you wish?

3151
03:06:20,710 --> 03:06:21,550
Just tell me.

3152
03:06:24,240 --> 03:06:25,140
I don't...

3153
03:06:25,140 --> 03:06:27,020
You know, I don't need nothing, really.

3154
03:06:31,800 --> 03:06:33,500
I can tell what you're thinking.

3155
03:06:35,860 --> 03:06:36,260
Oh.

3156
03:06:37,040 --> 03:06:37,720
No, no, no.

3157
03:06:38,180 --> 03:06:39,720
I'm trying to get money out of you.

3158
03:06:41,520 --> 03:06:42,720
Don't get it twisted now.

3159
03:06:43,180 --> 03:06:46,880
My mother gave it to me and said I should give it only to the man who will be my husband.

3160
03:06:48,140 --> 03:06:50,240
You might call it the Sora's engagement ring.

3161
03:06:51,600 --> 03:06:52,000
Um...

3162
03:06:52,000 --> 03:06:53,660
This was not in the contract.

3163
03:06:55,080 --> 03:06:55,480
Alright.

3164
03:06:57,020 --> 03:06:58,960
I'll give you my most precious possession.

3165
03:06:59,900 --> 03:07:00,860
Sora Sapphire.

3166
03:07:03,460 --> 03:07:04,840
Again, like, how old are we?

3167
03:07:04,900 --> 03:07:06,140
Are we supposed to be a kid or not?

3168
03:07:06,340 --> 03:07:07,060
What do you mean husband?

3169
03:07:10,770 --> 03:07:12,250
I don't understand ages.

3170
03:07:12,950 --> 03:07:14,310
In the Zelda universe.

3171
03:07:21,950 --> 03:07:24,210
Well, I'm just happy right now.

3172
03:07:24,290 --> 03:07:25,930
Happy that she actually wasn't serious.

3173
03:07:28,130 --> 03:07:30,210
I thought we were going to get married for a second there.

3174
03:07:31,230 --> 03:07:32,390
You obtained Sora Sapphire.

3175
03:07:32,590 --> 03:07:35,470
This is the spiritual stone of water passed down by the Soras.

3176
03:07:36,490 --> 03:07:37,010
Nice.

3177
03:07:37,570 --> 03:07:39,170
Her most precious possession.

3178
03:07:39,830 --> 03:07:41,610
You don't know what she's talking about.

3179
03:07:41,910 --> 03:07:44,570
But you finally collected all three spiritual stones.

3180
03:07:45,990 --> 03:07:47,830
Go back to see Princess Zelda.

3181
03:07:52,130 --> 03:07:53,230
Don't tell my father.

3182
03:07:54,470 --> 03:07:54,950
Uh...

3183
03:07:54,950 --> 03:07:55,830
I'm telling your father.

3184
03:07:56,830 --> 03:07:58,970
Because that's apparently how you progress in this game.

3185
03:07:59,350 --> 03:08:00,370
Whenever you say no...

3186
03:08:00,370 --> 03:08:01,510
I say yes.

3187
03:08:01,750 --> 03:08:02,850
And we tell your father.

3188
03:08:04,510 --> 03:08:05,310
Like, don't...

3189
03:08:05,310 --> 03:08:05,870
Don't dive.

3190
03:08:07,270 --> 03:08:07,750
Don't...

3191
03:08:07,750 --> 03:08:08,530
Where am I right now?

3192
03:08:11,970 --> 03:08:12,450
I...

3193
03:08:12,450 --> 03:08:13,050
Wait, where am I?

3194
03:08:13,750 --> 03:08:14,230
Oh!

3195
03:08:14,230 --> 03:08:16,250
I thought I was in Hylian Lake.

3196
03:08:17,830 --> 03:08:18,610
But I'm not.

3197
03:08:18,810 --> 03:08:19,310
This is different.

3198
03:08:22,340 --> 03:08:23,920
So I came from over there...

3199
03:08:24,700 --> 03:08:25,180
Ish.

3200
03:08:26,820 --> 03:08:28,720
I see a little door on the map.

3201
03:08:35,740 --> 03:08:36,620
Is time running?

3202
03:08:36,720 --> 03:08:37,400
No, it's not running.

3203
03:08:37,500 --> 03:08:37,860
It's 12.

3204
03:08:39,600 --> 03:08:40,580
Okay, watch this.

3205
03:08:42,740 --> 03:08:44,080
One of these will get destroyed.

3206
03:08:45,340 --> 03:08:46,260
Oh-ho-ho!

3207
03:08:46,980 --> 03:08:47,340
Baby!

3208
03:08:49,220 --> 03:08:50,180
Nothing is...

3209
03:08:50,860 --> 03:08:51,340
Secretive.

3210
03:08:51,540 --> 03:08:51,840
For me.

3211
03:08:52,960 --> 03:08:54,000
Great fairy's...

3212
03:08:54,000 --> 03:08:54,460
Fountain.

3213
03:08:55,560 --> 03:08:56,900
We're gonna learn an ability.

3214
03:08:59,300 --> 03:08:59,820
Uh...

3215
03:09:01,300 --> 03:09:02,480
Time to play a song.

3216
03:09:19,400 --> 03:09:20,100
Let's go.

3217
03:09:20,620 --> 03:09:23,000
Let's see where the particles will emanate from today.

3218
03:09:34,620 --> 03:09:35,140
Welcome...

3219
03:09:35,140 --> 03:09:35,460
Link!

3220
03:09:35,660 --> 03:09:37,640
I am the great fairy of magic!

3221
03:09:38,740 --> 03:09:40,700
I will give you a magic spell.

3222
03:09:40,940 --> 03:09:41,240
Please.

3223
03:09:41,780 --> 03:09:42,300
Take it.

3224
03:09:48,690 --> 03:09:50,690
Okay, it's coming from her mouth this time.

3225
03:09:59,000 --> 03:10:01,060
You got Farore's Wind.

3226
03:10:01,320 --> 03:10:03,160
That's one of the, uh...

3227
03:10:03,160 --> 03:10:04,720
The Sisters of the Sky, right?

3228
03:10:05,720 --> 03:10:09,020
Justice and divinity and law and all that.

3229
03:10:10,020 --> 03:10:12,520
This is warp magic you can use with C.

3230
03:10:12,700 --> 03:10:13,960
Warp when you are in danger?

3231
03:10:15,680 --> 03:10:16,200
What?

3232
03:10:16,540 --> 03:10:18,480
You will teleport to the warp point.

3233
03:10:18,960 --> 03:10:21,900
When you first use the magic, you will create a warp point.

3234
03:10:22,820 --> 03:10:29,420
When you use the magic again, you can either dispel the warp point you created last time, or warp to that point.

3235
03:10:31,020 --> 03:10:31,520
Oh!

3236
03:10:32,260 --> 03:10:34,600
It's like a mobile fast travel thing.

3237
03:10:35,300 --> 03:10:39,640
Remember, you can use Farore's Wind only in dungeons that have a dungeon map hidden inside.

3238
03:10:40,180 --> 03:10:40,680
Okay.

3239
03:10:42,520 --> 03:10:43,840
Wait, I can't use it outside?

3240
03:10:44,800 --> 03:10:48,320
When battle has made you wary, please come back to see me.

3241
03:10:52,600 --> 03:10:53,560
I don't think I will.

3242
03:10:54,020 --> 03:10:55,560
Unless you have more spells to offer.

3243
03:10:59,700 --> 03:11:00,100
Okay.

3244
03:11:00,320 --> 03:11:00,600
Thanks.

3245
03:11:01,440 --> 03:11:02,260
Let me try that.

3246
03:11:05,960 --> 03:11:06,980
I can't do it in here.

3247
03:11:07,420 --> 03:11:07,820
Okay.

3248
03:11:14,840 --> 03:11:15,880
I can't use it here.

3249
03:11:15,980 --> 03:11:17,480
Okay, so maybe it's only in dungeons, then.

3250
03:11:19,560 --> 03:11:21,900
Uh, let's go to that little hole on the map.

3251
03:11:22,900 --> 03:11:24,560
In fact, there's multiple paths here.

3252
03:11:25,880 --> 03:11:26,900
From what I can see.

3253
03:11:31,040 --> 03:11:32,920
I wonder what this place is called right here.

3254
03:11:35,380 --> 03:11:36,460
Wait, can I see that here?

3255
03:11:41,910 --> 03:11:43,970
Soros dom- I mean, I'm in Soros Domain, I guess.

3256
03:11:44,230 --> 03:11:44,890
North of it.

3257
03:11:45,570 --> 03:11:46,990
Could still be...

3258
03:11:48,130 --> 03:11:49,570
Considered Soros Domain, I'm not sure.

3259
03:11:56,310 --> 03:11:57,210
Oh, I'm here!

3260
03:11:57,430 --> 03:11:58,410
Oh, okay.

3261
03:11:59,550 --> 03:11:59,910
Right.

3262
03:12:01,350 --> 03:12:02,470
Let me just destroy these.

3263
03:12:04,690 --> 03:12:06,130
I also want to check something real quick.

3264
03:12:06,210 --> 03:12:06,690
Let me go in here.

3265
03:12:12,140 --> 03:12:13,440
Did we miss a chest or something?

3266
03:12:19,390 --> 03:12:20,390
Not that I can see.

3267
03:12:20,570 --> 03:12:21,570
It looks clean.

3268
03:12:24,070 --> 03:12:25,050
Okay, good.

3269
03:12:27,980 --> 03:12:28,700
Nice.

3270
03:12:29,540 --> 03:12:30,740
Now we go back.

3271
03:12:32,120 --> 03:12:33,740
Her father will be thrilled.

3272
03:12:41,600 --> 03:12:42,320
Hello.

3273
03:12:43,920 --> 03:12:45,500
Nice camera angle there.

3274
03:12:46,340 --> 03:12:48,600
Did my most precious possession help you in your quest?

3275
03:12:51,720 --> 03:12:53,920
I haven't gone back to Zelda with it yet.

3276
03:12:55,620 --> 03:12:56,660
What about the big guy?

3277
03:13:00,060 --> 03:13:00,880
Hey, big guy.

3278
03:13:02,000 --> 03:13:03,420
Check out what I did for you.

3279
03:13:05,780 --> 03:13:06,660
Oh, Link!

3280
03:13:06,980 --> 03:13:08,780
So you saved the princess, eh?

3281
03:13:09,160 --> 03:13:10,700
I really appreciate it.

3282
03:13:12,400 --> 03:13:13,680
That's all I get?

3283
03:13:13,840 --> 03:13:13,940
That's all I get?

3284
03:13:13,940 --> 03:13:14,960
Not even...

3285
03:13:14,960 --> 03:13:16,500
Not a big treasure chest?

3286
03:13:16,680 --> 03:13:17,820
With massive gold?

3287
03:13:17,960 --> 03:13:18,740
Or a plot of land?

3288
03:13:19,740 --> 03:13:20,720
I get nothing?

3289
03:13:21,380 --> 03:13:22,820
Wow, what a king you are.

3290
03:13:24,400 --> 03:13:26,180
I saved your daughter and everything.

3291
03:13:31,960 --> 03:13:32,980
Okay, so now...

3292
03:13:35,420 --> 03:13:36,800
Trying to get a bit of money here.

3293
03:13:38,740 --> 03:13:40,680
Okay, let me see if these guys have anything to say now.

3294
03:13:42,860 --> 03:13:43,680
Oh, it's you.

3295
03:13:43,800 --> 03:13:44,100
Link!

3296
03:13:44,600 --> 03:13:47,680
Thanks to you, Lord Jabu Jabu is back to normal.

3297
03:13:47,680 --> 03:13:49,040
Oh, yeah.

3298
03:13:49,360 --> 03:13:50,320
I am the man.

3299
03:13:50,900 --> 03:13:51,740
I did that.

3300
03:13:52,220 --> 03:13:53,560
Let me tell you, it wasn't easy.

3301
03:13:54,060 --> 03:13:56,000
I had my fair share of troubles in there.

3302
03:13:57,200 --> 03:13:58,740
Uh, you still want to buy a fish, huh?

3303
03:13:59,820 --> 03:14:00,500
You know what?

3304
03:14:01,180 --> 03:14:02,080
I got you, fam.

3305
03:14:03,000 --> 03:14:04,400
I'm gonna bring a fish to that guy.

3306
03:14:06,160 --> 03:14:06,720
Why not?

3307
03:14:10,590 --> 03:14:11,570
We're gonna fish him up.

3308
03:14:15,840 --> 03:14:16,560
There we go.

3309
03:14:20,840 --> 03:14:22,120
Let's see if he appreciates this.

3310
03:14:30,660 --> 03:14:31,540
Check it out, my dude.

3311
03:14:33,560 --> 03:14:34,480
This is for you!

3312
03:14:36,680 --> 03:14:37,080
Uh!

3313
03:14:38,480 --> 03:14:38,880
Jesus!

3314
03:14:39,280 --> 03:14:40,200
Get that bag in there!

3315
03:14:42,200 --> 03:14:43,340
That was bugging out!

3316
03:14:43,520 --> 03:14:45,200
Good thing I put it back.

3317
03:14:47,180 --> 03:14:47,980
Uh, no.

3318
03:14:48,040 --> 03:14:48,780
I don't want to buy anything.

3319
03:14:49,700 --> 03:14:50,260
I'm good.

3320
03:14:52,780 --> 03:14:54,220
Okay, so now...

3321
03:14:54,680 --> 03:14:56,620
Uh, I guess we go back to Zelda.

3322
03:14:57,660 --> 03:14:58,060
Right?

3323
03:14:58,160 --> 03:14:59,060
There's nothing else to do here.

3324
03:15:02,150 --> 03:15:03,650
In fact, nothing is blinking.

3325
03:15:05,050 --> 03:15:06,050
But, I mean...

3326
03:15:06,050 --> 03:15:08,250
Uh, the best way back to Zelda would be...

3327
03:15:09,130 --> 03:15:10,430
We have a shortcut over here.

3328
03:15:11,670 --> 03:15:13,790
Oh, but that's gonna take me to the Lost Woods.

3329
03:15:15,250 --> 03:15:16,190
Is that faster?

3330
03:15:19,570 --> 03:15:22,210
I think it's gonna be approximately the same amount of time.

3331
03:15:24,490 --> 03:15:25,590
Let's go back via here.

3332
03:15:25,670 --> 03:15:26,350
I think this is faster.

3333
03:15:26,410 --> 03:15:28,690
We're gonna appear in the northeast, which is close to north.

3334
03:15:29,250 --> 03:15:30,310
With a castle-less.

3335
03:15:32,130 --> 03:15:33,370
I think this is faster.

3336
03:15:34,650 --> 03:15:36,670
Let me also equip this new spell we got.

3337
03:15:37,590 --> 03:15:39,510
See if there's any space we can use it.

3338
03:15:39,630 --> 03:15:40,550
Okay, we can't use it here either.

3339
03:15:41,490 --> 03:15:42,670
I think it's only in the dungeon.

3340
03:15:45,410 --> 03:15:49,730
I'm gonna mentally prepare myself for a puzzle in a dungeon where I will need to use this.

3341
03:15:51,270 --> 03:15:53,170
You know, like, reappear where I was earlier.

3342
03:15:55,210 --> 03:15:56,110
Like, Navi, what is it?

3343
03:15:57,650 --> 03:15:59,430
You collected three spiritual stones!

3344
03:15:59,810 --> 03:16:01,150
Let's go back to Hyrule Castle.

3345
03:16:01,590 --> 03:16:02,330
Yeah, I'm on my way.

3346
03:16:03,350 --> 03:16:03,970
I'm on it.

3347
03:16:06,210 --> 03:16:07,030
It's gonna be great.

3348
03:16:07,870 --> 03:16:08,970
Maybe collect some money here?

3349
03:16:13,440 --> 03:16:13,820
Yeah!

3350
03:16:18,000 --> 03:16:18,380
Amazing.

3351
03:16:18,540 --> 03:16:19,740
We're gonna show up with so much money, too.

3352
03:16:39,420 --> 03:16:40,180
Let's go, Link.

3353
03:16:40,280 --> 03:16:40,860
I wonder...

3354
03:16:44,300 --> 03:16:44,940
Here we go!

3355
03:16:46,960 --> 03:16:48,600
This is the ultimate travel method.

3356
03:16:48,800 --> 03:16:49,740
Although it's a little difficult.

3357
03:16:49,740 --> 03:16:50,520
Actually, I can't...

3358
03:16:50,520 --> 03:16:51,580
It is faster, right?

3359
03:16:52,280 --> 03:16:53,320
Look at this!

3360
03:16:55,480 --> 03:16:56,320
Look at me.

3361
03:16:57,060 --> 03:16:58,080
Look at me.

3362
03:16:58,900 --> 03:16:59,840
Oh, it's night.

3363
03:17:01,300 --> 03:17:03,180
Uh, we gotta play the melody of...

3364
03:17:03,180 --> 03:17:04,200
of non-night.

3365
03:17:15,750 --> 03:17:16,690
Ba-da-ba-da-bum!

3366
03:17:21,240 --> 03:17:21,960
That's right!

3367
03:17:22,780 --> 03:17:24,060
See ya, nerds!

3368
03:17:25,480 --> 03:17:26,660
See ya, nerds!

3369
03:17:26,820 --> 03:17:27,220
Wait, what?

3370
03:17:29,660 --> 03:17:30,600
It's not open!

3371
03:17:30,860 --> 03:17:31,160
Oh!

3372
03:17:43,140 --> 03:17:44,740
Why are they not opening the gates?

3373
03:17:49,540 --> 03:17:51,780
I have a bad feeling about this.

3374
03:18:00,290 --> 03:18:01,870
Wait, is this...

3375
03:18:04,640 --> 03:18:05,840
No way!

3376
03:18:11,270 --> 03:18:11,870
No!

3377
03:18:12,970 --> 03:18:14,150
It's just like the dream!

3378
03:18:14,290 --> 03:18:14,370
Oh!

3379
03:18:20,770 --> 03:18:22,130
Oh my god.

3380
03:18:23,050 --> 03:18:24,850
Oh, the evil man.

3381
03:18:27,490 --> 03:18:28,970
Give me the sumen on his...

3382
03:18:28,970 --> 03:18:29,690
On his O-face.

3383
03:18:34,280 --> 03:18:34,780
Ah!

3384
03:18:35,320 --> 03:18:36,360
I lost her!

3385
03:18:37,200 --> 03:18:37,880
Wait, what?

3386
03:18:40,040 --> 03:18:40,540
You!

3387
03:18:40,720 --> 03:18:41,220
Over there!

3388
03:18:41,880 --> 03:18:42,400
Little kid!

3389
03:18:46,040 --> 03:18:48,620
You must have seen the White Horse Gala Pass just now.

3390
03:18:49,180 --> 03:18:50,060
Which way did it go?

3391
03:18:50,360 --> 03:18:51,140
Answer me!

3392
03:18:52,520 --> 03:18:54,620
I-I-I- Uh...

3393
03:18:55,800 --> 03:18:56,440
Uh...

3394
03:18:56,440 --> 03:18:59,600
So, you think you can protect them from me?

3395
03:19:00,300 --> 03:19:01,720
You've got guts, kid!

3396
03:19:05,850 --> 03:19:06,810
Come at me!

3397
03:19:08,930 --> 03:19:10,190
Ha ha ha ha ha!

3398
03:19:10,730 --> 03:19:11,030
Okay.

3399
03:19:15,010 --> 03:19:16,510
You want a piece of me?

3400
03:19:17,330 --> 03:19:18,590
Very funny.

3401
03:19:19,130 --> 03:19:20,410
I like your attitude!

3402
03:19:31,640 --> 03:19:32,660
Oh, that hurt.

3403
03:19:34,960 --> 03:19:36,480
Pathetic little fool!

3404
03:19:36,940 --> 03:19:39,340
Do you realize who you're dealing with?

3405
03:19:40,740 --> 03:19:41,940
Actually, I don't.

3406
03:19:42,480 --> 03:19:43,360
Who are you?

3407
03:19:43,980 --> 03:19:45,940
I am Ganondorf!

3408
03:19:46,460 --> 03:19:49,120
And soon I will rule the world.

3409
03:19:55,990 --> 03:19:57,390
You ain't gonna rule shit.

3410
03:19:57,850 --> 03:19:59,530
I will find you...

3411
03:20:00,030 --> 03:20:01,230
And I will kill you.

3412
03:20:07,100 --> 03:20:08,060
Oh, man.

3413
03:20:08,200 --> 03:20:10,420
Look at the determination in that...

3414
03:20:10,420 --> 03:20:11,080
Face!

3415
03:20:16,270 --> 03:20:17,810
Wait, did this just happen or was it a dream again?

3416
03:20:18,310 --> 03:20:19,690
Why is everything bright now again?

3417
03:20:22,450 --> 03:20:23,430
Was I daydreaming?

3418
03:20:24,730 --> 03:20:25,790
No, that happened, right?

3419
03:20:25,870 --> 03:20:27,410
That was for sure what happened just now.

3420
03:20:31,220 --> 03:20:31,620
Open.

3421
03:20:34,790 --> 03:20:35,490
Oh, wait a minute!

3422
03:20:35,990 --> 03:20:37,450
What about the thing that fell in the water?

3423
03:20:45,750 --> 03:20:46,150
Ah!

3424
03:20:46,430 --> 03:20:46,650
Okay!

3425
03:20:48,510 --> 03:20:50,050
I almost forgot about this!

3426
03:20:52,830 --> 03:20:53,330
Get it.

3427
03:20:55,270 --> 03:20:55,810
Wait, what?

3428
03:20:59,960 --> 03:21:00,780
We got it!

3429
03:21:02,860 --> 03:21:04,780
You found the Ocarina of Time!

3430
03:21:05,380 --> 03:21:06,800
Don't I have that already?

3431
03:21:07,780 --> 03:21:10,740
This is the royal family's hidden treasure which Zelda left behind.

3432
03:21:11,300 --> 03:21:12,900
It glows with a mystical light.

3433
03:21:15,240 --> 03:21:15,880
Okay.

3434
03:21:18,320 --> 03:21:19,900
Maybe a more powerful version.

3435
03:21:21,060 --> 03:21:21,360
Link!

3436
03:21:21,580 --> 03:21:22,480
Can you hear me?

3437
03:21:22,880 --> 03:21:24,420
It's me, Zelda.

3438
03:21:26,960 --> 03:21:27,440
Link!

3439
03:21:27,860 --> 03:21:30,000
When you hold this Ocarina in your hand.

3440
03:21:31,580 --> 03:21:32,060
Yes?

3441
03:21:32,860 --> 03:21:34,320
I won't be around anymore.

3442
03:21:37,160 --> 03:21:40,500
I wanted to wait for you, but I couldn't delay any longer.

3443
03:21:43,760 --> 03:21:46,380
At least I could leave you the Ocarina and this melody.

3444
03:21:57,540 --> 03:21:58,800
Opens the door of time.

3445
03:22:15,290 --> 03:22:17,290
Oh, that's such a nice song!

3446
03:22:20,750 --> 03:22:22,790
You've learned the Song of Time.

3447
03:22:24,410 --> 03:22:26,030
That is a great song.

3448
03:22:33,890 --> 03:22:34,490
Now...

3449
03:22:34,490 --> 03:22:34,730
Link!

3450
03:22:35,010 --> 03:22:38,130
Play this melody in front of the altar in the Temple of Time.

3451
03:22:38,830 --> 03:22:40,990
You must protect the Triforce.

3452
03:22:45,710 --> 03:22:46,610
I will!

3453
03:22:49,440 --> 03:22:50,380
I will!

3454
03:22:51,060 --> 03:22:52,420
I will do it, Zelda!

3455
03:22:53,400 --> 03:22:55,960
I will find you and I will rescue you!

3456
03:22:56,600 --> 03:22:57,780
But first...

3457
03:22:58,500 --> 03:23:01,000
Daddy needs to roll around in these...

3458
03:23:01,000 --> 03:23:01,780
Yeah!

3459
03:23:03,060 --> 03:23:03,960
That's right!

3460
03:23:04,320 --> 03:23:06,180
This is what I really crave.

3461
03:23:07,360 --> 03:23:08,200
Mm-mm.

3462
03:23:11,840 --> 03:23:12,480
Yeah.

3463
03:23:12,780 --> 03:23:13,400
That's it.

3464
03:23:14,700 --> 03:23:15,860
No blue ones, eh?

3465
03:23:16,940 --> 03:23:17,340
Oh no!

3466
03:23:17,340 --> 03:23:18,720
No, I'm too slow!

3467
03:23:19,920 --> 03:23:20,320
Embarrassing.

3468
03:23:21,940 --> 03:23:23,580
We gotta have a lot of money for the town.

3469
03:23:25,920 --> 03:23:27,320
Because I want to buy everything.

3470
03:23:30,060 --> 03:23:31,720
Then we gotta go to the Temple of Time.

3471
03:23:32,080 --> 03:23:33,420
And play a special song.

3472
03:23:35,320 --> 03:23:36,400
And something will happen.

3473
03:23:38,340 --> 03:23:39,220
Can we see it in here?

3474
03:23:42,530 --> 03:23:43,270
Song of Time.

3475
03:23:44,910 --> 03:23:46,290
Man, there's so many songs left!

3476
03:23:46,390 --> 03:23:46,750
What the?

3477
03:23:47,710 --> 03:23:48,110
What?

3478
03:23:49,870 --> 03:23:50,390
Like...

3479
03:23:50,390 --> 03:23:51,870
I already got all the stones!

3480
03:23:53,750 --> 03:23:55,610
How is there this much left of the game?

3481
03:23:56,830 --> 03:23:57,350
What?

3482
03:23:59,170 --> 03:23:59,690
You.

3483
03:24:00,370 --> 03:24:01,410
Oh, so scary!

3484
03:24:01,550 --> 03:24:02,130
So scary!

3485
03:24:03,210 --> 03:24:03,990
What's scary?

3486
03:24:06,470 --> 03:24:07,450
I'm late, I'm late!

3487
03:24:07,630 --> 03:24:08,650
For a very important day!

3488
03:24:08,650 --> 03:24:11,090
Okay, I guess you're still in that mood.

3489
03:24:11,730 --> 03:24:14,850
I guess the scariness was the guy stealing the princess.

3490
03:24:16,070 --> 03:24:22,150
That guy riding on the black horse must have been Ganondorf, who was renowned as the Gerudo King of Thieves.

3491
03:24:22,930 --> 03:24:23,450
Wow.

3492
03:24:24,490 --> 03:24:25,010
Really?

3493
03:24:26,990 --> 03:24:27,510
Kid!

3494
03:24:30,250 --> 03:24:31,110
Speak to me!

3495
03:24:31,650 --> 03:24:32,470
Okay, never mind.

3496
03:24:35,460 --> 03:24:35,980
Hey!

3497
03:24:36,200 --> 03:24:36,920
Who bumped me?

3498
03:24:37,580 --> 03:24:38,320
It wasn't me!

3499
03:24:38,520 --> 03:24:39,200
I didn't do it!

3500
03:24:39,600 --> 03:24:40,260
I didn't do it!

3501
03:24:40,680 --> 03:24:41,740
These guys are still rotating.

3502
03:24:43,060 --> 03:24:43,540
Oh!

3503
03:24:44,300 --> 03:24:45,760
You are so handsome!

3504
03:24:47,240 --> 03:24:47,720
Okay.

3505
03:24:48,000 --> 03:24:51,060
They have no perception of what just happened.

3506
03:24:51,280 --> 03:24:54,600
The guy just rode through the city, with the princess on his back.

3507
03:24:54,800 --> 03:24:59,160
The weather changed, dramatic music played, and these guys didn't even notice at all.

3508
03:25:00,000 --> 03:25:00,800
It's just rotating.

3509
03:25:02,060 --> 03:25:03,640
Uh, I gotta save the game.

3510
03:25:03,800 --> 03:25:07,200
Also, we gotta talk to a certain lady in the potion shop.

3511
03:25:08,620 --> 03:25:10,380
Save on this one.

3512
03:25:10,840 --> 03:25:11,400
Yes.

3513
03:25:13,700 --> 03:25:15,440
And then we gotta go to the Temple of Time.

3514
03:25:16,260 --> 03:25:16,980
Hey, hey!

3515
03:25:17,440 --> 03:25:18,620
Temple of Time, baby!

3516
03:25:19,480 --> 03:25:20,320
Let's do it.

3517
03:25:21,640 --> 03:25:22,920
Temple of Time.

3518
03:25:23,380 --> 03:25:24,720
Temple of Time.

3519
03:25:25,380 --> 03:25:26,380
But next time.

3520
03:25:27,180 --> 03:25:29,180
Because now we're stopping for today.

3521
03:25:29,660 --> 03:25:30,260
That's it.

3522
03:25:30,420 --> 03:25:31,500
That's the cliffhanger.

3523
03:25:32,240 --> 03:25:33,220
That's how we do it.

3524
03:25:38,150 --> 03:25:38,610
Hehehe.

3525
03:25:40,070 --> 03:25:41,490
Was that mean or what?

3526
03:25:42,650 --> 03:25:45,030
I think that was devilishly delightful.

3527
03:25:52,590 --> 03:25:53,210
Oh, yeah.

3528
03:25:57,050 --> 03:25:58,530
Dude, I was so absorbed today.

3529
03:25:58,690 --> 03:25:59,830
I forgot to drink.

3530
03:26:00,290 --> 03:26:01,610
The stuff I had to drink.

3531
03:26:03,290 --> 03:26:04,890
I also forgot to take a break.

3532
03:26:04,890 --> 03:26:05,350
That's fine.

3533
03:26:06,130 --> 03:26:06,930
I had fun.

3534
03:26:07,870 --> 03:26:10,330
I had some real troubles in that dungeon, but...

3535
03:26:10,330 --> 03:26:13,290
As soon as we overcame that little burden...

3536
03:26:13,290 --> 03:26:15,770
Everything just went smooth after that.

3537
03:26:17,930 --> 03:26:19,690
Oh, we also had another burden, I guess.

3538
03:26:19,810 --> 03:26:20,750
With the king.

3539
03:26:21,030 --> 03:26:21,590
And the...

3540
03:26:22,190 --> 03:26:23,510
And the proclamation.

3541
03:26:24,350 --> 03:26:25,650
That we had to show him, you know?

3542
03:26:27,010 --> 03:26:29,230
Other than that, I would say everything went pretty good.

3543
03:26:34,590 --> 03:26:35,990
At the same time tomorrow...

3544
03:26:35,990 --> 03:26:36,190
No, no.

3545
03:26:36,270 --> 03:26:37,450
Tomorrow I'm going to a friend.

3546
03:26:37,490 --> 03:26:38,410
And we're gonna have fajitas.

3547
03:26:38,590 --> 03:26:39,510
And we're gonna go ice skating.

3548
03:26:42,800 --> 03:26:44,460
I don't have a regular stream schedule.

3549
03:26:45,480 --> 03:26:47,400
I just stream whenever I want to play the games.

3550
03:26:50,060 --> 03:26:51,360
That's one hell of a cliffhanger.

3551
03:26:51,680 --> 03:26:52,000
Ha ha!

3552
03:26:52,420 --> 03:26:52,740
Gotcha!

3553
03:26:53,900 --> 03:26:55,200
Then we have something to look forward to.

3554
03:26:57,300 --> 03:26:58,340
Tell us when the next stream is?

3555
03:26:58,400 --> 03:26:58,860
I don't know.

3556
03:26:59,680 --> 03:27:00,260
That's the thing.

3557
03:27:00,360 --> 03:27:02,820
I don't know how I'll feel the day after tomorrow.

3558
03:27:02,940 --> 03:27:05,080
I don't want to start a stream when I don't feel like playing, right?

3559
03:27:06,680 --> 03:27:09,460
But usually I will try to announce it at least the day before.

3560
03:27:11,540 --> 03:27:14,100
So on Discord or on the schedule on Twitch.

3561
03:27:14,100 --> 03:27:15,380
I will try to put it up there.

3562
03:27:23,250 --> 03:27:26,670
Probably the day after tomorrow or the day after tomorrow is tomorrow.

3563
03:27:28,190 --> 03:27:29,070
Does that make sense?

3564
03:27:29,790 --> 03:27:31,830
Either in two days or three days is what I'm saying.

3565
03:27:31,950 --> 03:27:32,530
One of those days.

3566
03:27:32,730 --> 03:27:33,970
I'm like 99% sure.

3567
03:27:36,510 --> 03:27:38,010
Can you do five more minutes, please?

3568
03:27:38,250 --> 03:27:40,310
Yeah, I'm chatting with you guys for five minutes.

3569
03:27:40,470 --> 03:27:42,930
And then I'm going to buy some food.

3570
03:27:43,990 --> 03:27:44,730
Actually, not true.

3571
03:27:44,790 --> 03:27:46,090
I'm going to cook it because I already bought it.

3572
03:27:49,220 --> 03:27:50,360
Yeah, Thursday or Friday.

3573
03:27:53,420 --> 03:27:54,940
Übermorgen oder überübermorgen?

3574
03:27:56,260 --> 03:27:57,060
Uh, überübermorgen.

3575
03:27:57,680 --> 03:27:58,320
Denk ich mal.

3576
03:28:02,860 --> 03:28:03,580
What are you cooking?

3577
03:28:04,140 --> 03:28:05,700
I am cooking some very...

3578
03:28:05,700 --> 03:28:06,660
Well, it's not really cooking.

3579
03:28:07,180 --> 03:28:08,340
It's just boiling some eggs.

3580
03:28:08,920 --> 03:28:11,480
Boiling some eggs, then I have some, uh...

3581
03:28:11,480 --> 03:28:12,860
Oh god, what's the word for it?

3582
03:28:13,520 --> 03:28:14,740
A macot...

3583
03:28:14,740 --> 03:28:15,700
Uh...

3584
03:28:15,700 --> 03:28:16,360
Mackerel!

3585
03:28:16,780 --> 03:28:18,760
So mackerel in a...

3586
03:28:18,760 --> 03:28:20,020
In a can, right?

3587
03:28:20,340 --> 03:28:21,260
Canned mackerel.

3588
03:28:21,520 --> 03:28:24,080
With tomato sauce, you put it on some rye bread.

3589
03:28:24,400 --> 03:28:27,680
Then you put boiled eggs, sliced, on top.

3590
03:28:27,820 --> 03:28:28,680
Mayonnaise, pepper.

3591
03:28:28,940 --> 03:28:30,000
A little bit of salt.

3592
03:28:30,660 --> 03:28:31,500
And that's it.

3593
03:28:31,600 --> 03:28:32,120
That's the food.

3594
03:28:32,180 --> 03:28:32,600
It's amazing.

3595
03:28:33,880 --> 03:28:35,080
That's not a mackerel.

3596
03:28:36,580 --> 03:28:36,940
Mackerel.

3597
03:28:37,320 --> 03:28:38,040
The fish.

3598
03:28:41,610 --> 03:28:43,910
So yeah, the cooking is pretty much just boiling eggs.

3599
03:28:45,410 --> 03:28:46,350
You'll be full from that?

3600
03:28:46,490 --> 03:28:48,230
I mean, I eat like two of the rye breads, right?

3601
03:28:48,670 --> 03:28:49,730
Yeah, it's pretty fulfilling.

3602
03:28:50,270 --> 03:28:54,450
You get a lot of fibers from the bread, and you get a lot of protein from the egg, and...

3603
03:28:55,010 --> 03:28:56,650
You get satisfied with the mayonnaise.

3604
03:28:56,890 --> 03:28:57,110
It's...

3605
03:28:57,110 --> 03:28:58,150
It's really good.

3606
03:29:02,600 --> 03:29:03,960
You watched inscription videos.

3607
03:29:03,960 --> 03:29:05,360
What a wild ride that game was, huh?

3608
03:29:05,460 --> 03:29:05,660
Yeah.

3609
03:29:06,580 --> 03:29:07,340
Actually, it's...

3610
03:29:07,340 --> 03:29:08,940
I haven't even thought about inscription for...

3611
03:29:10,500 --> 03:29:11,460
Like, a couple months.

3612
03:29:11,460 --> 03:29:12,680
I haven't even thought about the game.

3613
03:29:12,740 --> 03:29:13,280
That's crazy.

3614
03:29:13,860 --> 03:29:14,980
But yeah, that was a good game.

3615
03:29:20,440 --> 03:29:21,900
Hey, Maximilian, did you enjoy it?

3616
03:29:23,800 --> 03:29:25,140
Did you play the DLC as well?

3617
03:29:25,500 --> 03:29:26,580
Or just the main game?

3618
03:29:33,240 --> 03:29:36,100
Next time you stream, check in with us, like, five to ten minutes in.

3619
03:29:36,200 --> 03:29:36,340
Why?

3620
03:29:36,500 --> 03:29:37,060
What happened?

3621
03:29:37,660 --> 03:29:39,420
Did something happen today ten minutes in?

3622
03:29:42,460 --> 03:29:44,260
Was there a technical problem or something?

3623
03:29:45,320 --> 03:29:46,240
Do you mean kneggapol...

3624
03:29:46,240 --> 03:29:47,280
No, no, I mean rye bread.

3625
03:29:48,360 --> 03:29:51,380
So, think of a slice of toast, except it's not toast.

3626
03:29:51,440 --> 03:29:52,620
It's actually very healthy.

3627
03:29:53,120 --> 03:29:54,060
It's very dark.

3628
03:29:55,400 --> 03:29:57,320
It has lots of...

3629
03:29:57,800 --> 03:29:58,760
Well, what's the word?

3630
03:29:59,920 --> 03:30:00,960
Seeds in the bread.

3631
03:30:01,320 --> 03:30:01,520
You know?

3632
03:30:02,660 --> 03:30:03,400
It's just bread.

3633
03:30:05,560 --> 03:30:06,400
Just do it?

3634
03:30:09,590 --> 03:30:10,290
Oh, I see.

3635
03:30:10,390 --> 03:30:10,530
Okay.

3636
03:30:14,920 --> 03:30:15,760
You loved it?

3637
03:30:16,080 --> 03:30:16,760
Aye, nice.

3638
03:30:17,500 --> 03:30:18,960
Dude, Out of Wilds is...

3639
03:30:19,420 --> 03:30:20,220
It's wild.

3640
03:30:21,820 --> 03:30:24,640
I actually doubt we will ever get another game like that.

3641
03:30:24,900 --> 03:30:26,080
I just don't see it.

3642
03:30:26,860 --> 03:30:28,560
It is such a unique experience.

3643
03:30:30,240 --> 03:30:35,760
And everything about that game was perfect for me as well, because I'm loving everything space-related, you know?

3644
03:30:35,960 --> 03:30:41,700
The story was incredible, the novelty of the gameplay and the puzzles, it was beautiful.

3645
03:30:42,440 --> 03:30:44,060
Just a masterpiece, really.

3646
03:30:45,660 --> 03:30:48,940
I hope we get another game like that someday, but I don't know.

3647
03:30:50,360 --> 03:30:52,040
I don't think it can be surpassed.

3648
03:30:54,000 --> 03:30:58,180
Uh, I played a tiny bit of Astroneer with a friend, but we're talking half an hour.

3649
03:30:59,920 --> 03:31:01,760
Unless I'm mistaking it for another game.

3650
03:31:03,620 --> 03:31:05,540
I think I've played a little bit of Astroneer.

3651
03:31:05,740 --> 03:31:06,320
Very little.

3652
03:31:10,360 --> 03:31:12,220
The Out of Wilds team is making another game.

3653
03:31:12,400 --> 03:31:13,080
It could be...

3654
03:31:13,080 --> 03:31:13,520
Really?

3655
03:31:14,880 --> 03:31:17,360
But they're not making, like, another Out of Wilds, right?

3656
03:31:17,440 --> 03:31:18,720
They're making a whole new game?

3657
03:31:23,210 --> 03:31:24,390
What about No Man's Sky?

3658
